          "exemptions": "The source says the law may not apply to two- or three-unit owner-occupied premises with two or fewer rental units. It does not apply to hotel, motel or guest-house guests who are transient or seasonal tenants, though hotel and motel occupants with no alternate residence who live there continually are covered. It does not apply to a unit held in trust for a developmentally disabled immediate family member who permanently occupies it.",
